// uefi-setup: setup through the USB keyboard: DEL at the POST prompt, Right
// to the Advanced tab, Enter on Hardware Monitor (the PMC's sensors and the
// fan monitor on I2C).
// vsim-args: -b test -M 128 -K "6M:Delete 6M:Right 4M:Enter" -c 40000000
// expect-exit: 3   (the cycle limit: setup waits for keys)
// expect-vga: Aptio-style Setup Utility - Copyright (C) 2026 The vibe86 project
// expect-vga: Main   Advanced   Boot   Security   Save & Exit
// expect-vga: CPU Temperature
// expect-vga: Fan 0 Speed
